# IDEA PIPELINE: КАРТА ПРОЦЕССА

> **TL;DR:** Идея → classify intent → pipeline фаз → delegate existing workflow → FINISH → next chat.

## ПОТОК

```mermaid
graph TD
    Start["IDEA PIPELINE<br>идея пользователя"] --> Read["activeContext<br>productContext<br>tasks.md"]
    Read --> Classify["INTAKE:<br>intent + PM-L + DEV-L"]
    Classify --> Build["Построить цепочку<br>фаз из workflow"]
    Build --> Save["idea-slug.md<br>portfolio + tasks"]
    Save --> Exec["EXECUTE фаза N<br>delegate role workflow"]
    Exec --> Artifact["Артефакт роли<br>pm/front/back/…"]
    Artifact --> Finish{"IDEA PIPELINE<br>FINISH?"}
    Finish -->|да| Update["idea-* done<br>Handoff + doc-router"]
    Update --> More{"Ещё фазы?"}
    More -->|да| NewChat["New chat<br>NEXT COMMAND"]
    NewChat --> Exec
    More -->|нет| Done["REFLECT / ARCHIVE<br>pipeline complete"]
    Finish -->|continue| Exec
```

